(text "Plugs into the main board on two 2.54 mm headers. Power pins: 4 per rail, about 3 A each." (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 302b9f8a-81ac-464f-b4f7-9c2abd63ef48))
(text "eFuse settings: OVP 31.8 V (255k/10k), current limit 6.0 A (3.01k), UVLO default 15.5 V, about 11 ms soft start at 24 V (22 nF)." (at 20.32 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ed2e5f9c-3788-4d7d-ba7e-a2febb88e8dd))
(text "MODE open = latch-off after an overload (default). Close JP to GND for auto-retry. SHDN left open (internal pull-up)." (at 20.32 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid d548f5c4-3851-480c-a204-33791f227b29))
(text "PGTH and PGOOD are tied to GND (power-good unused; TI allows PGOOD at GND). FLT and IMON go to the main board." (at 20.32 31.75 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 6e1952f0-3394-4eb1-bec7-f267089ff556))
(text "Reverse polarity: Q1 blocks it (TI arrangement: Q1 source to IN_SYS, drain to IN, gate to B_GATE; Q2 pulls B_GATE down)." (at 20.32 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5ad2500f-9362-47be-93f4-f38095d22705))
(text "TVS SMCJ51CA: stays off with a 48 V supply plugged in by mistake; the eFuse OVP disconnects the board." (at 20.32 39.37 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 26b231ac-e656-4b58-82f0-0e752228226d))
(text "TPS7A4901: +5VA = 1.185 V x (1 + 32.4k/10k) = 5.02 V. 10 nF on NR/SS and across the top resistor (CFF)." (at 20.32 43.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ac363fd2-75b4-4a24-8b66-f3c323ff7551))
